      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Classify the customer's message into one of these intents:\nconfirm, reschedule_with_time, reschedule_no_time, question, cancel, other.\n\nUse reschedule_with_time if the customer asks to change the appointment AND mentions a day or time. Use reschedule_no_time if they want to change it but give no day or time.\n\nAlso extract \"detail\": the day or time they mentioned, or an empty string if none.\n\nCustomer message: {{ $('Customer reply received').item.json.message.text }}\n\nReply with JSON only, no extra text, no code fences:\n{\"intent\": \"...\", \"detail\": \"...\"}",
